# =============================================================================
# Data Directory — Git Ignore Rules
# Part of T004 — Phase 1 Setup
# Data files are tracked via DVC + Git LFS; NOT committed to git directly.
# Reference: plan.md Project Structure
# =============================================================================

# Ignore all data files by default
*
!.gitignore
!.dvcignore
!*.dvc
!*.gitkeep

# Keep placeholder files
!.gitkeep

# DVC tracking files are tracked by git
# The actual data files are NOT (DVC handles them externally)
